oth sites have improved a lot recently."}]},{"markdown":"Re-added + Starred [Gmailnator](https://fmhy.net/internet-tools#temp-mail).","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"Temp mail site with Gmail addresses."}]}]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"things-removed","markdown":"Things Removed"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"markdown":"Removed Fmovies as it's been offline for weeks. We've replaced it with","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"[FBOX](https://fmhy.net/video#multi-server) for now."}]},{"markdown":"Removed Cipher Files as they've [shut down](https://ibb.co/gzYX4Gb).","children":[]},{"markdown":"Removed Homeworkify as they've [shut down](https://ibb.co/wJp6B3b).","children":[]},{"markdown":"Unstarred both Awesome Privacy and Hitchhiker’s Guide in Privacy Indexes, and","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"bumped PrivacyGuides.org to the top. PrivacyGuides is high quality and updated more often than others."}]}]}]}